# The Tellomi build no longer reads this file at startup.
# The existing server endpoint and the server RSA public keys are compiled
# into DcOptions, the same way upstream Telegram Desktop compiles its list.
# That endpoint uses port 10443, the claimed production port.
# Port 11443 is the claimed pre-release port and is not compiled in.
# Telegram production DCs, loopback, and the emulator host stay rejected.
